    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lydon Farrell Property are delighted to present 3 Sli Garmon, Slane, Co. Meath to the market. This attractive four bedroom bungalow is located within the well-regarded Slí Garmon development in the heart of Slane and is situated on a mature 0.42 acre elevated site. Sli Garmon is an exclusive development of five large family homes located off a quiet cul de sac on the northern side of Slane Village. \r\n\r\nThis beautiful home is nestled within mature landscaped gardens that supplement the stunning natural stone exterior finish of this house. Internally this well proportioned four bedroom bungalow extends to approximately 151sqm that was designed for practical modern living. This family home features an entrance foyer, an impressive open plan sitting room and dining area, separate kitchen and an adjoining breakfast nook creating practicality for family living. The home comprises of a family bathroom and four spacious bedrooms one of which features an ensuite and walk in wardrobe.  \r\n\r\nThis family home is presented in turnkey condition suitable for a wide variety of purchasers. The property benefits from a large rear garden with mature trees and a variety of shrubs and planting providing a sense of privacy along with a paved patio area that is ideal for outdoor living. Residents at Sli Garmon enjoys a private walkway that leads directly to a convenience store, pharmacy and take away.\r\n\r\nSlane is a historic village in Meath and renowned for Slane Castle and historic scenic walks and attractions along the River Boyne. Slane Village offers a variety of cafes, restaurants, shops, schools and sporting facilities along with public transport to the surrounding areas. The immediate area is serviced by excellent road connectivity via the N2 and nearby junction of the M1 Motorway, allowing for straight forward access to Dublin making it an attractive option for commuters."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
