        "Content": "Exclusive development of just 5 family homes.\r\nSituated on a private mature 0.42 acre elevated site.\r\nSpacious open plan layout incorporating 4 large double bedrooms.\r\nLocated within walking distance of all local amenities.\r\nSituated on a quiet cul de sac."
      },
